{{Quote|Whoever said "The sky's the limit" never met Astrodactyl!|Astrodactyl.<ref name="AFoB">''[[A Fistful of Brains]]''</ref>}}
'''Astrodactyl''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Astrodactyl's Species|unknown species]] from an unknown planet.{{Refn|group = note|On December 6, 2013, a statement from [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] that claimed that [[Astrodactyl's Species|Astrodactyl's species]] is from [[Terradino (Classic)|Terradino]] was added to Astrodactyl's page.{{Refn|[[:File:Astrodactyl From Terradino.png]]|group = DJW}} This info remained there as a fact until March 2025 when it was discovered that Derrick initially stated the idea as a joke among many other made-up species and planet names.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Joke Species and Planet Names.png]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Astrodactyl being from Terradino would had been cool.png]]|group = DJW}} Soon after, [[Charlotte McDuffie]] too debunked the idea of Astrodactyl's species being from Terradino on March 8, 2025.{{Refn|[[:File:Astrodactyl is not from Terradino.png]]|group = CM}}{{Refn|[[Ben 10 Planet:Longstanding Misinformation]]|group = BTP|name = misinfo}}}}

==Appearance==
Astrodactyl resembles a cross between a [[Wikipedia:Pterodactylus|Pterodactyl]] and a glider. He has a large yellow beak-like mouth, green eyes, red skin, black and green clothing on his shoulders and waist, green braces around his wrists and ankles, and small yellow retractable wings that resemble a glider in appearance which are connected to a 'jetpack'-like structure on his back.

Astrodactyl wears the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his left shoulder.

