==Etymology==
Astrodactyl's name is a portmanteau of the prefix "astro-", meaning star, referencing his abilities, and "pterodactyl", a flying reptile, referencing his appearance.

==Trivia==
*Whenever Astrodactyl talks or becomes excited, he "squawks" like a parrot.
*Despite both of them being flying animal-inspired aliens with green energy-related abilities, Astrodactyl was never meant to be [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]]'s "replacement" in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.{{Refn|[[:File:Astrodactyl Did Not Replace Jetray.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
**Furthermore, the crew never intended or even wanted to replace any aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:DJW No Intention of Replacing Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
*The crew came up with Astrodactyl's name first and then figured out his appearance and powers.{{Refn|[[:File:Astrodactyl Development.png]]|group = DJW}}
**He was designed by [[Steven Choi]].{{Refn|[[:File:Steven Choi Designed Astrodactyl.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Astrodactyl cannot jump into hyperspace.{{Refn|[[:File:Jetray and Astrodactyl Cannot Jump Into Hyperspace.png]]|group = DJW}}

